00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.149
Bagian Gim yang menyiapkan ini.

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:11.384
Terima kasih.

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:13.553
Kami mampu membuat gim populer

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.888
