00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.541
Gim sosial.

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:37.410
Gim sosial?

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:39.479
Maksudmu gim ponsel?

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.347
