00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:07.740
Oh.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:09.008
Baik.

00:05:09.876 --> 00:05:10.710
Apa?

00:05:11.678 --> 00:05:12.512
{\an8}HARU

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:13.946
{\an8}VS PERUSAHAAN GIM ATHLEO

