- Keren!

00:05:46.746 --> 00:05:49.282
{\an8}Pertemuan tak bisa dijadwalkan
untuk permintaan itu.

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.583
{\an8}Kami mengerti.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:51.617
{\an8}Terima kasih.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:52.552
{\an8}Terima kasih.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:58.124
{\an8}Usaha rintisan TI-mu
