00:09:19.992 --> 00:09:20.893
Apa?

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.931
Sedari kecil, kerjaku hanya
bermain gim dan tidur.

00:09:24.997 --> 00:09:26.766
Hanya bermain gim.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.869
Aku tulus menyukai gim.

00:09:30.536 --> 00:09:32.939
